---
import ToolLayout from '../../layouts/ToolLayout.astro';
import { STOPS, MIN_EXP, MAX_EXP, HOME_EXP, AU } from '../../scripts/cosmic-scale/model';
import '../../styles/cosmic-scale.css';
const featured = ['dna', 'cell', 'cup', 'city', 'earth', 'solar', 'galaxy', 'observable'];
const scaleTicks = [{ label: '30 纳米', metres: 30e-9 }, { label: '1 米', metres: 1 }, { label: '1 AU', metres: AU }, { label: '2,760 亿光年', metres: 3 * STOPS.at(-1)!.size }];
---
<ToolLayout title="宇宙尺度电梯 · 从杯子到可观测宇宙" description="拖动一把连续的对数尺，从手边的杯子走向细胞、DNA、城市、地球、银河、星系团与可观测宇宙。四十余个可见参照、连续缩放与同一比例尺，把中间的每一层连接起来。" currentSlug="cosmic-scale">
  <div slot="header" class="cosmic-heading">
    <div><p class="cosmic-eyebrow">A JOURNEY THROUGH SCALE</p><h1>宇宙尺度电梯</h1></div>
    <p>小到藏在一滴血里<br />大到看见可观测宇宙</p>
  </div>
  <section id="cosmic-app" class="cosmic-app" aria-label="宇宙尺度交互体验">
    <div class="cosmic-topline"><span><i aria-hidden="true"></i> 换一把尺，重新看世界</span><span>{STOPS.length} 个参照 · 约 {Math.round(MAX_EXP - MIN_EXP)} 个数量级</span></div>
    <div class="cosmic-experience">
      <div id="cosmic-stage" class="cosmic-stage" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="尺度画布，可用左右方向键缩放，PageUp 和 PageDown 跳站" aria-describedby="cosmic-key-help">
        <canvas id="cosmic-canvas" aria-label="按当前视野宽度缩放的尺度插画">此浏览器不支持画布。下方的尺寸、站点与来源仍可阅读。</canvas>
        <div class="cosmic-field"><span>眼前这片视野的宽度</span><output id="cosmic-field-size">36 厘米</output></div>
        <div class="cosmic-direction" aria-hidden="true"><span>− 微观</span><span>宇宙 +</span></div>
        <div class="cosmic-lane-note"><span>同一比例 · 并列比较</span><span id="cosmic-lane-caption">硬币 → 杯子</span></div>
        <div class="cosmic-ruler"><span id="cosmic-ruler-label">5 厘米</span><small>实际比例尺</small></div>
        <span class="cosmic-art-note" id="cosmic-art-note">尺寸按比例 · 插画非照片</span>
        <div class="cosmic-zoom" aria-label="缩放控制">
          <button type="button" id="cosmic-in" aria-label="向微观缩小视野十倍" title="向微观：视野 ÷ 10">−</button>
          <button type="button" id="cosmic-out" aria-label="向宇宙扩大视野十倍" title="向宇宙：视野 × 10">+</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="cosmic-progress" id="cosmic-progress" aria-hidden="true"><i></i></div>
    <aside class="cosmic-card" aria-label="当前尺度说明">
      <div class="cosmic-current"><div><p id="cosmic-chapter" class="cosmic-chapter">02 / 触手可及</p><h2 id="cosmic-name">你手边的杯子</h2></div><p id="cosmic-dimension" class="cosmic-dimension">示例总宽 12 厘米</p></div>
      <p id="cosmic-fact" class="cosmic-fact">旅程从一个熟悉的物件开始。每向外跨一格，视野就扩大 10 倍，杯子会缩小到原来的十分之一。</p>
      <details class="cosmic-reading"><summary>这幅画怎样比较？ <span id="cosmic-kind" class="cosmic-kind">选定尺度 · 示意</span></summary><div class="cosmic-card-bottom"><p id="cosmic-caveat">示例杯子含把手总宽 12 厘米；不是所有杯子的标准尺寸，蒸汽不计入宽度。</p><a id="cosmic-source" href="#cosmic-method" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" hidden>科学来源 ↗</a><p>物体并列摆放，位置不是星图或真实嵌套。实体轮廓、轨道直径与距离线各按标注长度绘制；极小物体会真实缩小。轨道上的点、星团和宇宙网中的光点是放大的定位标记。最后的圆圈是可观测范围，不是宇宙的实体边缘。</p></div></details>
    </aside>
    <div class="cosmic-console">
      <div class="cosmic-console-top"><label for="cosmic-range">拖动，穿越尺度</label><span id="cosmic-exponent">对数尺 · 每一整格 = 10 倍</span></div>
      <input id="cosmic-range" type="range" min={MIN_EXP} max={MAX_EXP} value={HOME_EXP} step="0.005" aria-label="视野尺度" />
      <div class="cosmic-scale-labels" aria-hidden="true">{scaleTicks.map((tick, index) => <span data-metres={tick.metres} class={index === 0 ? "first" : index === scaleTicks.length - 1 ? "last" : undefined} style={`left:${(Math.log10(tick.metres) - MIN_EXP) / (MAX_EXP - MIN_EXP) * 100}%`}>{tick.label}</span>)}</div>
      <nav class="cosmic-stops" aria-label="尺度快捷站点">{STOPS.filter(stop => featured.includes(stop.id)).map(stop => <button type="button" data-stop={stop.id} aria-pressed={stop.id === 'cup'}><span class="cosmic-stop-dot" style={`--stop-color:${stop.color}`}></span>{stop.id === 'cup' ? '杯子' : stop.id === 'cell' ? '细胞' : stop.id === 'dna' ? 'DNA' : stop.id === 'solar' ? '太阳系' : stop.name}</button>)}</nav>
      <div class="cosmic-transport">
        <div class="cosmic-actions"><button type="button" id="cosmic-play" aria-pressed="false">▷ 自动向外旅行</button><button type="button" id="cosmic-home">回到杯子</button><button type="button" id="cosmic-prev" aria-label="上一尺度站点">← 上一站</button><button type="button" id="cosmic-next" aria-label="下一尺度站点">下一站 →</button></div>
        <label class="cosmic-wheel"><input id="cosmic-wheel" type="checkbox" /> 在画布上用滚轮缩放</label>
      </div>
      <div class="cosmic-statusrow"><p id="cosmic-status" role="status">已停在杯子旁。向左去微观，向右去宇宙。</p><label class="cosmic-jump">全部站点 <select id="cosmic-select" aria-label="选择尺度站点">{STOPS.map(stop => <option value={stop.id} selected={stop.id === 'cup'}>{stop.name}</option>)}</select></label></div>
      <p id="cosmic-key-help" class="cosmic-help">画布键盘：← / → 缩放，PageUp / PageDown 跳站，Home 回杯子，End 到可观测宇宙，空格播放或暂停。任何手动操作都会暂停旅行。</p>
    </div>
    <noscript><p class="cosmic-noscript">开启 JavaScript 后可拖动尺度。下方仍保留完整尺寸表与参考来源。</p></noscript>
  </section>
  <div class="cosmic-explainer" id="cosmic-method">
    <section><span class="cosmic-number">01</span><h2>不是越来越大的数字<br />是看见中间的每一层</h2><p>视野宽度每扩大 10 倍，物体在画面上就缩小到十分之一。标尺始终使用实际长度；纳米、微米、米、千米、天文单位与光年，只是同一把尺的不同写法。</p></section>
    <section><span class="cosmic-number">02</span><h2>比例是真的<br />画面是一种解释</h2><p>相邻参照在同一比例里并排出现。旧物体逐渐缩小，新物体先露出边缘，再进入视野。排列位置不表示真实空间关系；轨道、星团里的定位点放大显示，颜色与细节为示意。</p></section>
    <section><span class="cosmic-number">03</span><h2>给尺度一个停顿<br />再继续出发</h2><p>默认静止。你可以随时打断自动旅行；切换到其他标签页会暂停，不会偷偷继续。系统开启“减少动态效果”时，跳站即时完成，自动旅行关闭。</p></section>
  </div>
  <nav class="cosmic-related" aria-label="继续探索"><span>继续探索</span><a href="/tools/planet-builder/">造一颗星球 ↗</a><a href="/tools/black-hole/">靠近黑洞 ↗</a><a href="/space/">去轻星图看看 ↗</a></nav>
  <details class="cosmic-data"><summary>查看全部尺寸、建模约定与科学来源</summary><div class="cosmic-data-grid">{STOPS.map(stop => <article><h3>{stop.name}</h3><p>{stop.dimension}</p><small>{stop.caveat}</small>{stop.source && <a href={stop.source.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{stop.source.name} ↗</a>}</article>)}</div><p>单位换算：1 AU = 149,597,870,700 米；1 光年取光速 299,792,458 米/秒乘以儒略年 365.25 天。银河、星系群与宇宙结构的尺寸均为近似参照。可观测宇宙的现今直径取约 920 亿光年，整个宇宙的大小仍未知。生物尺寸也为约值，不表达超出资料的测量精度。<a href="https://iauarchive.eso.org/public/themes/measuring/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">IAU · 天文长度单位 ↗</a></p></details>
</ToolLayout>
<script>
  import { bootCosmicScale } from '../../scripts/cosmic-scale/main';
  bootCosmicScale();
</script>
